      "preview": "Summary This report concludes Phase I (Audit and Modeling) of the FAIRwDDI WP3-ST3 project and delivers a comprehensive technical audit of the current ReQuest platform, plus a validated, standard-agnostic database architecture aligned with DDI-Lifecycle 3.3 , DDI 4.0 (COGS) , and...",
      "text": "Summary This report concludes Phase I (Audit and Modeling) of the FAIRwDDI WP3-ST3 project and delivers a comprehensive technical audit of the current ReQuest platform, plus a validated, standard-agnostic database architecture aligned with DDI-Lifecycle 3.3 , DDI 4.0 (COGS) , and DDI-CDI ."
