      "text": "Executive Summary — Standard-Agnostic DDI Architecture & Decisions (DDI 4 / DDI-CDI / DDI-L) Project: FAIRwDDI WP3 ST3 — Implementation of DDI Architecture for ReQuest Organization: Centre des Données Socio-Politiques (CDSP), Sciences Po / CNRS Duration: July 20 – December 18, 2026 (25 days) Status: Phase I Architecture & Technical Specification Summary Deliverable ---"
