      "text": "Core Web Views ( request ddi/urls.py ) - GET / : RepresentedVariableSearchView — Homepage and search entry. - POST /search-results/ : search results — Search execution view returning HTML fragments. - GET /question/<id quest / : QuestionDetailView — Detailed view of a question and its statistical categories across surveys. - GET /import/ & POST /import/ : CSVUploadViewCollection — File upload interface. - GET /import/status/ : ImportStatusView — Real-time progress monitoring for background tasks. - POST /export-csv/ : export page — Data export in CSV format."
