      "preview": "2. Database Schema & Domain Model Evolution To support DDI-Lifecycle, the relational database schema in PostgreSQL must be extended to support persistent URNs, versioning, decoupled code lists, and localized text fields.",
      "text": "2. Database Schema & Domain Model Evolution To support DDI-Lifecycle, the relational database schema in PostgreSQL must be extended to support persistent URNs, versioning, decoupled code lists, and localized text fields."
