      "preview": "A. Parser Engine Replacement - Current : BeautifulSoup(content, \"xml\") in request ddi/core/parser.py . - Target : lxml.etree.iterparse targeting DDI-Lifecycle 3.3 XML schemas ( rddi:ResourcePackage , g:Group , s:StudyUnit , d:DataRelationship ). Stream-parses large XML files with...",
