      "text": "9. Live Demo 2: Real-World DDI Repository &amp; BaseX Corpus Analysis <div class=\"grid-2\" <div style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42;\" - Harvested DDI Corpus: Large collection of real-world DDI 3.3 XML files in local ddi/ directory (CLOSER UK, CSO Ireland, MIDUS, ESS SIKT, UK Data Service). - Repository Note: Not committed to GitHub due to multi-GB file size and archive licensing constraints (copies available upon request). - BaseX XML Database Live Demo: High-speed XQuery queries across 50M+ real-world DDI nodes . - Corpus Inventory Spreadsheet: Detailed distribution of resource types, flavours, and structural patterns across archives. </div <div class=\"card\" style=\"background: 0f172a; color: f8fafc; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; padding: 10px; line-height: 1.4;\" <span style=\"color: 94a3b8;\" Harvested Corpora in ddi/ Folder</span <br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" • CLOSER UK:</span 12 cohorts, 50M+ items (BaseX)<br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" • CSO Ireland:</span 67 studies, 6,044 questions<br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" • MIDUS USA:</span Longitudinal panel packages<br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" • ESS SIKT &amp; UKDS:</span European Social Surv"
