      "text": "10. Live Demo 3: Data Artifex DDI Toolkit ( dartfx-ddi ) <div class=\"grid-2\" <div style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42;\" - Open-Source Toolchain: Data Artifex DDI Toolkit ( github.com/dataartifex/ddi-toolkit ). - Project Structure: Focus on the ddilifecycle module for high-performance streaming parsing. - Cross-Standard Translation Bridge: Direct streaming conversion of DDI-Lifecycle (3.2/3.3) into DDI 4.0 JSON &amp; XML. - International Community Contribution: Tested by SIKT (Norway) ; represents a major reusable contribution to the wider DDI community. </div <div class=\"card\" style=\"background: 0f172a; color: f8fafc; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; padding: 10px; line-height: 1.4;\" <span style=\"color: 94a3b8;\" 1. Toolkit CLI Help</span <br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" dartfx-ddi --help</span <br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" dartfx-ddi ddil324 --help</span <br <br <span style=\"color: 94a3b8;\" 2. Extract DDI-L 3.3 File Statistics</span <br <span style=\"color: 4ade80;\" dartfx-ddi ddil324 --stats sample cso.ddi33.xml</span <br <br <span style=\"color: 94a3b8;\" 3. Stream &amp; Convert to DDI 4.0 (JSON/XML)</span <br <span style=\"color: 38bdf8;\" dartfx-dd"
