      "preview": "FAIRwDDI Lifecycle ![Python 3.12+](https://www.python.org/downloads/) ![DDI 4.0 & DDI-CDI](https://ddialliance.org/) ![Framework](https://django-ninja.rest-framework.com/) ![License: MIT](LICENSE) ![CDSP / Sciences Po](https://cdsp.sciences-po.fr/) FAIRwDDI WP3 ST3 — Implementati...",
      "text": "FAIRwDDI Lifecycle ![Python 3.12+](https://www.python.org/downloads/) ![DDI 4.0 & DDI-CDI](https://ddialliance.org/) ![Framework](https://django-ninja.rest-framework.com/) ![License: MIT](LICENSE) ![CDSP / Sciences Po](https://cdsp.sciences-po.fr/) FAIRwDDI WP3 ST3 — Implementation of a standard-agnostic DDI Data Model (aligned with DDI 4.0 and DDI-CDI , with DDI-Lifecycle 3.3 compatibility) for the CDSP ReQuest Question Bank. ---"
