      "preview": "🛠️ Technology Stack Category Technology / Tool Description :--- :--- :--- Language Python 3.12+ Core language runtime Package Management uv Fast package resolution and environment management Build System hatchling / hatch-vcs PEP 517 build backend with dynamic versioning Framewor...",
      "text": "🛠️ Technology Stack Category Technology / Tool Description :--- :--- :--- Language Python 3.12+ Core language runtime Package Management uv Fast package resolution and environment management Build System hatchling / hatch-vcs PEP 517 build backend with dynamic versioning Framework Django ≥ 5.0 / Django Ninja Web framework & high-performance OpenAPI REST interface DDI Toolkit dartfx-ddi Data Artifex DDI Lifecycle toolkit Database PostgreSQL 17 via psycopg3 Relational database with JSONB and ICU multilingual collations Search Engine Elasticsearch 9.x Multilingual full-text indexing and faceted search Validation Pydantic v2 High-speed schema validation and serialization XML Processing lxml ( iterparse ) Streaming XML parsing for large DDI instances CLI & Formatting Typer & Rich Interactive terminal command-line interface Quality & Tests pytest, Ruff, Pyrefly Testing, linting, formatting, and static type checking ---"
